# Keys / signing
# Exception: the development keystore and properties are tracked so that
# CI (and anyone cloning the repo) can build the release APK out of the box.
# For Play Store production uploads, replace with your own production keystore
# via Play App Signing and keep THAT keystore out of version control.
!android/key.properties
!android/app/aura_release.keystore
